{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":11431,\"title\":\"De Kotmadam\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"'De Kotmadam' was a classic Flemish comedy television series, that aired from 1991 to 2024, meaning the show is the longest running Belgian sitcom in terms of time and amounts of episodes and seasons.\\n\\nThe series revolves around Jeanne Piens, who owns a small sweet shop in the centre of Leuven and rents out several rooms of her house to students studying in the city. She is a caring type and loves all her students. Her husband Jef Liefooghe works for the city's gardening department. Except for the last season, their friend Odilon Bonheur, a naïve warden in the local prison, visits regularly to give or seek help.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7G0fkvAV1yTFxijg5F7NAKrueMq.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wqk0FyASiUZJCa71WO7O0o7qXTk.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":8,\"year\":1991,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":25,\"totalEpisodes\":352,\"createdBy\":[\"Frans Ceusters\"],\"networks\":[\"VTM\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"BE\",\"name\":\"Belgium\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-12-28\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1095181,\"name\":\"Ronnie Commissaris\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3085926,\"name\":\"Jos Van Geel\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4805024,\"name\":\"Tony Proesmans\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1416130,\"name\":\"Katrien Devos\",\"character\":\"Jeanne Liefooghe-Piens\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1105151,\"name\":\"Mark Verstraete\",\"character\":\"Jef Liefooghe\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n4PpiaKhzYBBrcVKLcOJlaUudiT.jpg\"},{\"id\":3013226,\"name\":\"Frederik Huys\",\"character\":\"Victor Kindermans\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3083566,\"name\":\"Helle Vanderheyden\",\"character\":\"Martha\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6RQx